"AR Choppers", "keywords": ["chopper", "heli", "flight", "helicopter", "flightsim"], "long_description": "Fly 16 amazing helicopters in mixed-reality or experience them at actual size!  \n\nAll models are finely detailed and scaled to 1/32.  Enjoy realistic flight physics tuned meticulously for mixed-reality play!\n\nChoppers:\n\u2022 Bell 47\n\u2022 Robinson R44\n\u2022 Bell 206 JetRanger\n\u2022 Airbus AS350\n\u2022 UH-1 \"Huey\" Iroquois\n\u2022 UH-60 Black Hawk\n\u2022 SB-1 Defiant\n\u2022 CH-53 Sea Stallion\n\u2022 CH-47 Chinook\n\u2022 Mi-26 Halo\n\u2022 AH-1 Cobra\n\u2022 Mi-8 Hip\n\u2022 MH-6 Little Bird\n\u2022 Mi-24 Hind\n\u2022 Ka-52 Alligator\n\u2022 AH-64 Apache\n\nEach chopper type has a timed \"mission\" activity:\n\u2022 Crop spray: fly over crops to fertilize them!\n\u2022 Firefight: fill your bucket and douse wildfire!\n\u2022 Transport: deliver troops to the frontline!\n\u2022 Heavy lift: hook up a heavy load and drop it at its destination!\n\u2022 Attack: laser-designate targets to destroy them with guns and missiles!\n\nScan your room in Quest Environment setup and mission objects will be contained within it, otherwise a generic space is used.  Toggle wall-collision via radial menu (off by default).\n\nCheck out \"AR Planes\" for more scale-model  flight!", "short_description": "Fly 16 amazing helicopters around your room in mixed-reality or experience them at actual size!  Fire guns and missiles to destroy targets!  Spray crops!  Fight fires!  Transport troops!  Heavy lift!\n\nCheck out \"AR Planes\" for more indoor flight!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroom.space/archoppers/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vroom.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3